    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging and Fun Platformer Game\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players embody an adorable fox embarking on a thrilling adventure in a mystical forest illuminated by starlight. Navigate through 170 meticulously designed levels filled with diverse traps and creatures, offering over an hour of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Setting:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds in the \u200b<strong>\u200bStarry Sky Forest\u200b</strong>\u200b, where trees and plants glow softly under celestial light. Distant stars and planets float in the night sky, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. As the fox protagonist, players collect stardust fragments to unlock \u200b<strong>\u200bblack holes\u200b</strong>\u200b that teleport them to new zones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br><i>Keyboard:</i><br>\u2190\u2192/A/D - Move<br>Space - Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gamepad:</i><br>Left Stick - Move<br>A - Jump<br>B - Back<br>LB - Toggle Timer<br>RB - Toggle Level Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging and Fun Platformer Game\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players embody an adorable fox embarking on a thrilling adventure in a mystical forest illuminated by starlight. Navigate through 170 meticulously designed levels filled with diverse traps and creatures, offering over an hour of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Setting:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds in the \u200b<strong>\u200bStarry Sky Forest\u200b</strong>\u200b, where trees and plants glow softly under celestial light. Distant stars and planets float in the night sky, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. As the fox protagonist, players collect stardust fragments to unlock \u200b<strong>\u200bblack holes\u200b</strong>\u200b that teleport them to new zones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br><i>Keyboard:</i><br>\u2190\u2192/A/D - Move<br>Space - Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gamepad:</i><br>Left Stick - Move<br>A - Jump<br>B - Back<br>LB - Toggle Timer<br>RB - Toggle Level Loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
